# Sustainable Fashion Research Plan<br>
<br>
## Objectives<br>
* Gather insights from potential designers and manufacturers on sustainable production methods<br>
* Identify key areas for improvement in the fashion industry&#x27;s environmental impact<br>
<br>
## Key Questions to Ask<br>
<br>
### Material Sourcing<br>
* What materials do you use for your products?<br>
* Are these materials sourced sustainably or responsibly?<br>
* How do you ensure that your suppliers meet your sustainability standards?<br>
<br>
### Production Processes<br>
* Can you describe your production process, including any steps taken to reduce waste and energy consumption?<br>
* How do you ensure that your manufacturing processes are environmentally friendly?<br>
<br>
### Waste Management<br>
* What strategies do you have in place for reducing waste during production and post-consumer use?<br>
* How do you handle the disposal of end-of-life products?<br>
<br>
## Next Steps<br>
* Schedule interviews with potential designers and manufacturers to gather insights on sustainable production methods<br>
* Review and analyze data from interviews to identify key areas for improvement in the fashion industry&#x27;s environmental impact<br>
```<br>
